+        // [ff9mapkit s71-SPIKE] DWIX PATH D rung 1 (THROWAWAY): swap in a block hierarchy minted in C# at runtime
+        // instead of the one baked into the WorldMap scene. Default OFF; armed only from the debug menu, so a
